{
  "lineCounts": {
    "Basima": 11,
    "Paimon": 9,
    "Player": 6
  },
  "subQuests": [
    {
      "subId": "7352801",
      "subQuestName": "Talk to the cheerful scholar",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "735280101"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "735280101": {
            "id": "735280101",
            "speakerId": 30406,
            "speakerName": "Basima",
            "text": "Passing Travelers, I, Basima, Amurta researcher, beseech thee not to leave too hastily...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "735280102"
            ]
          },
          "735280102": {
            "id": "735280102",
            "speakerId": 30406,
            "speakerName": "Basima",
            "text": "Please. Relax thy body, clear thy mind, and listen closely, for I have a matter of utmost importance to share with you—",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "735280103"
            ]
          },
          "735280103": {
            "id": "735280103",
            "speakerId": 30406,
            "speakerName": "Basima",
            "text": "Finches are the cutest!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "735280104"
            ]
          },
          "735280104": {
            "id": "735280104",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "735280105"
            ]
          },
          "735280105": {
            "id": "735280105",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "735280106"
            ]
          },
          "735280106": {
            "id": "735280106",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Finches are definitely cute... But Miss Basima, you're a researcher, right? You should know saying something like that without any qualifications can lead to serious arguments!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "735280107"
            ]
          },
          "735280107": {
            "id": "735280107",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Paimon thought that scholars spoke a bit more cautiously. Paimon would never say something like \"Golden Shrimp Balls are the most delicious food!\" if Paimon was a researcher.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "735280108"
            ]
          },
          "735280108": {
            "id": "735280108",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Paimon would qualify her statement! Like, \"Among the Liyue cuisine Paimon's eaten lately, this is Paimon's favorite.\"",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "735280112"
            ]
          },
          "735280112": {
            "id": "735280112",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "#Wha— {NICKNAME}, that was really unexpected!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "735280113"
            ]
          },
          "735280113": {
            "id": "735280113",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Even if it's not a joke, you shouldn't be so loud...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "735280114"
            ]
          },
          "735280114": {
            "id": "735280114",
            "speakerId": 30406,
            "speakerName": "Basima",
            "text": "Hahaha, now that's the spirit!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "735280115"
            ]
          },
          "735280115": {
            "id": "735280115",
            "speakerId": 30406,
            "speakerName": "Basima",
            "text": "It is precisely because I am a researcher that I don't want my whole life to be like an academic debate, constantly worrying about the accuracy of every word that comes out of my mouth.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "735280116"
            ]
          },
          "735280116": {
            "id": "735280116",
            "speakerId": 30406,
            "speakerName": "Basima",
            "text": "It's not like I'm under constant surveillance! Speaking carelessly won't get me punished, so why live in constant fear?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "735280117"
            ]
          },
          "735280117": {
            "id": "735280117",
            "speakerId": 30406,
            "speakerName": "Basima",
            "text": "We should be brave, and shout out the most important feelings in our hearts as loud as we can for the world to hear!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "735280118"
            ]
          },
          "735280118": {
            "id": "735280118",
            "speakerId": 30406,
            "speakerName": "Basima",
            "text": "Once you've tried my tabletop game \"Bing-Bang Finchball\", I'm sure you wouldn't hesitate to shout out \"Finches are the cutest!\"",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "735280119"
            ]
          },
          "735280119": {
            "id": "735280119",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Bing-bang... Finchball? You mean those things on the table behind you?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "735280120"
            ]
          },
          "735280120": {
            "id": "735280120",
            "speakerId": 30406,
            "speakerName": "Basima",
            "text": "That's right, once you've played, you'll see for yourself just how adorable finches are!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "735280121"
            ]
          },
          "735280121": {
            "id": "735280121",
            "speakerId": 30406,
            "speakerName": "Basima",
            "text": "Also, as an official amusement venue of the Veluriyam Mirage, you'll be able to get rewards based on your score!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "735280122"
            ]
          },
          "735280122": {
            "id": "735280122",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "She's made it sound so dramatic... but it worked! Paimon's getting really curious. Plus, there are rewards for playing!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "735280123"
            ]
          },
          "735280123": {
            "id": "735280123",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "#What do you think, {NICKNAME}?"
          }
        }
      }
    }
  ]
}